{"corpus":"ccc","number":911,"text_html":"<span>Dans l’Église, « les fidèles laïcs peuvent coopérer selon le droit à l’exercice du pouvoir de gouvernement » <sup class=\"srcRef docRef\" data-idx=\"a\">a</sup>. Ainsi de leur présence dans les<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§2245</sup> Conseils particuliers <sup class=\"srcRef docRef\" data-idx=\"b\">b</sup>, les Synodes diocésains <sup class=\"srcRef docRef\" data-idx=\"c\">c</sup>, les Conseils pastoraux <sup class=\"srcRef docRef\" data-idx=\"d\">d</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup> ; dans l’exercice de la charge pastorale d’une paroisse <sup class=\"srcRef docRef\" data-idx=\"e\">e</sup> ; la collaboration aux Conseils des affaires économiques <sup class=\"srcRef docRef\" data-idx=\"f\">f</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"2\">2</sup> ; la participation aux tribunaux ecclésiastiques <sup class=\"srcRef docRef\" data-idx=\"g\">g</sup>, etc.</span>","cross_refs":["2245"],"bible_refs":[],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"canon_law","raw":"⇒ CIC, can. 129, § 2","idx":"a","doc_raw":"⇒ CIC, can. 129, § 2"},{"type":"canon_law","raw":"can. 443, § 4","idx":"b","doc_raw":"can. 443, § 4"},{"type":"canon_law","raw":"can. 463, §§ 1. 2","idx":"c","doc_raw":"can. 463, §§ 1. 2"},{"type":"canon_law","raw":"can. 511","idx":"d","doc_raw":"can. 511"},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"536","idx":1},{"type":"canon_law","raw":"can. 517, § 2","idx":"e","doc_raw":"can. 517, § 2"},{"type":"canon_law","raw":"can. 492, § 1","idx":"f","doc_raw":"can. 492, § 1"},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"536","idx":2},{"type":"canon_law","raw":"can. 1421, § 2","idx":"g","doc_raw":"can. 1421, § 2"}]}